                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2InlineElementsJson": "",
                  "html": "",
                  "text": "",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Some of you have been asking about forming sports and activity clubs for employees here at our headquarters. Well, I mentioned it to our CEO, and he has approved the idea. We'll allocate a budget to share among these clubs, and we’ll buy appropriate shorts and T-shirts for members to wear. Anyone who wishes to create a club should post a notice in the staff break room and register the club with our personnel office. A similar approach has been taken at our Maidenhead office over the past year, and 95 percent of employees are now involved.\"}]]}]]}"
